This package contains src/splatgif/model.py, a condensed re-implementation of
the network in Apple's ml-sharp, which remains under Apple's own terms:
licenses/APPLE-ML-SHARP-LICENSE (software). The SHARP model weights, which
this package downloads but does not contain, are licensed by Apple for
non-commercial research use only: licenses/APPLE-ML-SHARP-LICENSE_MODEL.
